  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida/DFID Governance  BUR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida/DFID Governance BUR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Good governance program samfinansierat av Sida och DFID i Burundi med ett antal delprojekt inom r&#xE4;ttssektorn, utbildningssektorn mm. Sida finansierar l&#xF6;nen f&#xF6;r en gemensam good governance r&#xE5;dgivare som arbetar vid DFIDs kontor i Bujumbura. Sida &#xE4;r &quot;silent partner&quot; till DFID.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Good governance programme, jointly financed by Sida and DFID in Burundi with a number of sub-project within the legal sector, education sector etc. Sida finances the salary of the good governance adviser who is posted at DFID&#xB4;s office in Bujumbura. Sida is a silent partner to DFID in this cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
